  "_comment": "Chuchu Beauty brand library. SAME shape as shades.json (tone -> step -> product) with an optional per-tone 'foundation', which is exactly what mergeBrandLibrary() in app.js already expects. Loading this file attaches these entries to the EXISTING recommendation for the same tone as additional candidates (.alt) - nothing in shades.json or foundations.json is replaced. bestProduct() then scores every candidate against the analysed skin tone and the selected makeup look and displays ONE winner, so Detail Cosmetics and Squad Cosmetics remain fully eligible. Within each tone this catalogue deliberately spans a RANGE: roughly half the shades sit closer to the skin than the primary entry (so they win on School / Professional) and half sit further from it (so they win on Date / Party). Verify shade names and hex values against your physical tray inventory before evaluation - the scoring reads the hex, so correcting a hex changes which brand is recommended.",

